{"transcription": [{"offsets": {"from": 1000, "to": 7000}, "text": " Hi, just a quick video, because I raise this question of myself on Twitter as I do all the time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 7000, "to": 14000}, "text": " I, after seeing this article in PV Magazine, major milestone for world's biggest solar project."}, {"offsets": {"from": 14000, "to": 19000}, "text": " The world's biggest solar and storage project is a step closer to realization as the government of Australia's Northern Territory,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 19000, "to": 25000}, "text": " that's up in the North, by the way, in case you didn't know, and Singapore-based Sun Cable have signed a deal"}, {"offsets": {"from": 25000, "to": 30000}, "text": " to advance the development of the Australia A-C-E-A-N power link."}, {"offsets": {"from": 30000, "to": 34000}, "text": " Basically, Australia to Asia power link, pretty much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 34000, "to": 37000}, "text": " An artist's rendition of what it's going to look like."}, {"offsets": {"from": 37000, "to": 41000}, "text": " There goes the Northern Territory, but there's a lot of room up in the Northern Territory."}, {"offsets": {"from": 41000, "to": 46000}, "text": " And yes, that's exactly what the Northern Territory looks like, minus the solar panels at the moment."}, {"offsets": {"from": 46000, "to": 52000}, "text": " So, yes, lots of sun up there and lots of open space, flat open space."}, {"offsets": {"from": 52000, "to": 55000}, "text": " Our solar insulation here in Australia is second to none."}, {"offsets": {"from": 55000, "to": 58000}, "text": " Insolation, not insu-lation."}, {"offsets": {"from": 58000, "to": 60000}, "text": " And anyway, let's have a read."}, {"offsets": {"from": 60000, "to": 65000}, "text": " Plans continue to gather steam to develop a 10 gigawatt solar farm"}, {"offsets": {"from": 65000, "to": 69000}, "text": " and a 30 gigawatt storage facility near Tennant Creek in Australia's Northern Territory"}, {"offsets": {"from": 69000, "to": 73000}, "text": " in order to export solar power to Singapore via submarine transmission link."}, {"offsets": {"from": 73000, "to": 77000}, "text": " This project will transform the territory into a renewable energy powerhouse."}, {"offsets": {"from": 77000, "to": 80000}, "text": " That's what we call it, it's just the territory."}, {"offsets": {"from": 80000, "to": 85000}, "text": " The solar farm and battery storage facility will be built across 12,000 hectares."}, {"offsets": {"from": 85000, "to": 89000}, "text": " That's a hobby farm, as Crocodile Dundee said."}, {"offsets": {"from": 89000, "to": 93000}, "text": " Anyway, at Power Creek Station, about 70 kilometers southwest of Elliot,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 93000, "to": 97000}, "text": " Northern Territory's Barkley region, as well as the region's climatic advantages,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 97000, "to": 101000}, "text": " the facility will capitalize on close access to road and rail infrastructure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 101000, "to": 106000}, "text": " Once operational, power from what will be Australia's largest renewable energy infrastructure project"}, {"offsets": {"from": 106000, "to": 111000}, "text": " will be exported via a high-voltage DC transmission link connecting the precinct"}, {"offsets": {"from": 111000, "to": 114000}, "text": " to the Darwin-Catherine interconnected system."}, {"offsets": {"from": 114000, "to": 121000}, "text": " Power will then be transported via a 3,800 kilometer high-voltage DC submarine cable to Singapore."}, {"offsets": {"from": 121000, "to": 124000}, "text": " The project is expected to generate enough renewable electricity"}, {"offsets": {"from": 124000, "to": 128000}, "text": " to power more than 3 million homes a year."}, {"offsets": {"from": 128000, "to": 130000}, "text": " In Singapore, that is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 130000, "to": 134000}, "text": " So I guess it's cost-effective to build this infrastructure in Australia"}, {"offsets": {"from": 134000, "to": 138000}, "text": " and transport it 3,800 kilometers to Singapore."}, {"offsets": {"from": 138000, "to": 139000}, "text": " Woo!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 139000, "to": 144000}, "text": " And it will supply up to 20% of Singapore's electricity needs."}, {"offsets": {"from": 144000, "to": 148000}, "text": " It is estimated the project will inject up to 8 billion Aussie dollaridoos"}, {"offsets": {"from": 148000, "to": 151000}, "text": " into the regional economy with about 1,500 jobs, blah blah blah."}, {"offsets": {"from": 151000, "to": 155000}, "text": " $1 billion worth of solar electricity per year upon completion."}, {"offsets": {"from": 155000, "to": 157000}, "text": " Export. Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 157000, "to": 161000}, "text": " So it commences in 2023, commercial operations in 2027."}, {"offsets": {"from": 161000, "to": 164000}, "text": " Yeah, it's going to take a long time to build all of that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 164000, "to": 166000}, "text": " Not only to manufacture the panels."}, {"offsets": {"from": 166000, "to": 168000}, "text": " Imagine installing that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 168000, "to": 171000}, "text": " Get the contract, you little pissant company."}, {"offsets": {"from": 171000, "to": 172000}, "text": " You bid for the contract."}, {"offsets": {"from": 172000, "to": 174000}, "text": " Oh jeez, how many panels?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 174000, "to": 177000}, "text": " It's just Arthur's impression, of course."}, {"offsets": {"from": 177000, "to": 182000}, "text": " I don't know how physically, I haven't calculated how physically large it would actually be."}, {"offsets": {"from": 182000, "to": 186000}, "text": " But anyway, it got me thinking, well, how much power does Singapore use"}, {"offsets": {"from": 186000, "to": 188000}, "text": " and what is 20% of that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 188000, "to": 194000}, "text": " And what are the losses to transport this 3,800 kilometers"}, {"offsets": {"from": 194000, "to": 198000}, "text": " under the ocean via cable to Singapore?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 198000, "to": 201000}, "text": " As it turns out, I've done some calculations on that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 201000, "to": 206000}, "text": " As I do, because, well, you know, it's one thing to just go, oh, that's interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 206000, "to": 209000}, "text": " But it's another thing to actually just get out your confuser"}, {"offsets": {"from": 209000, "to": 212000}, "text": " and plug some numbers in and find out this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 212000, "to": 217000}, "text": " So let's look at some estimated losses for a system like this, shall we?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 217000, "to": 219000}, "text": " Now, I actually goofed it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 219000, "to": 224000}, "text": " In up here, I've gone 3,200 kilometers for some reason."}, {"offsets": {"from": 224000, "to": 226000}, "text": " It's actually 3,800 kilometers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 226000, "to": 228000}, "text": " So anyway, good enough for Australia."}, {"offsets": {"from": 228000, "to": 229000}, "text": " We'll run with that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 229000, "to": 232000}, "text": " So how much power does Singapore use?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 232000, "to": 237000}, "text": " Well, around 50 terawatt hours per year."}, {"offsets": {"from": 237000, "to": 243000}, "text": " So yeah, I just took that and we're going to run with 50 terawatt hours per year"}, {"offsets": {"from": 243000, "to": 247000}, "text": " and we know it's going to supply 20% of that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 247000, "to": 249000}, "text": " So it's 10 terawatt hours per year."}, {"offsets": {"from": 249000, "to": 253000}, "text": " But, of course, that's an energy figure because it's a watt-hour figure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 253000, "to": 258000}, "text": " We need to work out what the power is and then, like,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 258000, "to": 260000}, "text": " so how much power it's actually transferring across the cable"}, {"offsets": {"from": 260000, "to": 262000}, "text": " because it doesn't matter how much energy it transfers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 262000, "to": 264000}, "text": " Energy's a time component."}, {"offsets": {"from": 264000, "to": 268000}, "text": " We care about the power it transfers because of the I squared R losses."}, {"offsets": {"from": 268000, "to": 270000}, "text": " P equals I squared R."}, {"offsets": {"from": 270000, "to": 273000}, "text": " So depending on how much power you're sending across,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 273000, "to": 276000}, "text": " that's going to be X amount of current at X amount of voltage"}, {"offsets": {"from": 276000, "to": 279000}, "text": " and therefore X amount of power loss in your cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 279000, "to": 281000}, "text": " And that's what we want to calculate."}, {"offsets": {"from": 281000, "to": 286000}, "text": " So I've assumed 500 kilovolts and a 1,300 square meter cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 286000, "to": 288000}, "text": " Where did I get these from?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 288000, "to": 289000}, "text": " Well, let's have a look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 289000, "to": 292000}, "text": " High voltage DC transmission here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 292000, "to": 297000}, "text": " This is like a typical, like, one of these submarine power cables, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 297000, "to": 299000}, "text": " And this is the Wikipedia article."}, {"offsets": {"from": 299000, "to": 304000}, "text": " Conductor sizes typically like less than 1,200 square millimeters,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 304000, "to": 309000}, "text": " but sizes up to 2,400 square millimeters have been used occasionally."}, {"offsets": {"from": 309000, "to": 312000}, "text": " And I found this over here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 312000, "to": 316000}, "text": " which was a high-voltage some sort of article."}, {"offsets": {"from": 316000, "to": 318000}, "text": " And this shows, here we go, here's a typical cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 318000, "to": 319000}, "text": " Looked different to the other one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 319000, "to": 322000}, "text": " The other one had the three cores in it, didn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 322000, "to": 324000}, "text": " Yeah, that one there's got three cores."}, {"offsets": {"from": 324000, "to": 326000}, "text": " By the way, I've done a video on this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 326000, "to": 331000}, "text": " which is the 140-megawatt Woolnorth wind farm in Tasmania,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 331000, "to": 332000}, "text": " which I visited."}, {"offsets": {"from": 332000, "to": 334000}, "text": " And yeah, I'll link in that video there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 334000, "to": 338000}, "text": " And there's some cross-section of some cables that I looked at there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 338000, "to": 341000}, "text": " And it's Huxley's hand, there I am at the wind farm."}, {"offsets": {"from": 341000, "to": 342000}, "text": " What face is that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 342000, "to": 343000}, "text": " Very windy there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 343000, "to": 347000}, "text": " That gets the cleanest air in the world, by the way."}, {"offsets": {"from": 347000, "to": 349000}, "text": " If you want to find out why, I guess watch my video."}, {"offsets": {"from": 349000, "to": 350000}, "text": " I think I mentioned it in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 350000, "to": 352000}, "text": " But anyway, yeah, Tasmania."}, {"offsets": {"from": 352000, "to": 353000}, "text": " Ripper."}, {"offsets": {"from": 353000, "to": 357000}, "text": " Anyway, so I used 1,300 square millimeters here"}, {"offsets": {"from": 357000, "to": 361000}, "text": " for a typical high-voltage DC undersea cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 361000, "to": 365000}, "text": " This one's actually 250 kilovolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 365000, "to": 369000}, "text": " Typical voltages, because it's the dielectric of the thing,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 369000, "to": 370000}, "text": " has to withstand this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 370000, "to": 373000}, "text": " You know, 420 kilovolts, 520 kilovolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 373000, "to": 377000}, "text": " So I just took like 500 kilovolts as a typical figure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 377000, "to": 381000}, "text": " I think somebody on Twitter mentioned like up to 1 megavolt."}, {"offsets": {"from": 381000, "to": 382000}, "text": " Or something like that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 382000, "to": 385000}, "text": " But anyway, let's just run with 500 kilovolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 385000, "to": 388000}, "text": " That seems to be a reasonable figure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 388000, "to": 390000}, "text": " So how much power does it transfer?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 390000, "to": 392000}, "text": " We don't actually know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 392000, "to": 395000}, "text": " So we've got to just like sort of just have a guess."}, {"offsets": {"from": 395000, "to": 397000}, "text": " Let's say 10 terawatt hours."}, {"offsets": {"from": 397000, "to": 400000}, "text": " Well, let's convert that to power."}, {"offsets": {"from": 400000, "to": 405000}, "text": " So divided by 365 days a year, divided by 24 hours in a day,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 405000, "to": 407000}, "text": " you get 1.14 gigawatts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 408000, "to": 412000}, "text": " That's close enough to 1.21 gigawatts!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 412000, "to": 413000}, "text": " With a J, gigawatts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 413000, "to": 416000}, "text": " So we're going to run with 1.21 gigawatts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 416000, "to": 419000}, "text": " Whoa, this is it. This is the part coming up, Doc."}, {"offsets": {"from": 419000, "to": 420000}, "text": " This sucker's electrical."}, {"offsets": {"from": 420000, "to": 423000}, "text": " And I need a nuclear reaction tube to generate the 1.21 gigawatts of electricity."}, {"offsets": {"from": 423000, "to": 424000}, "text": " What did I just say?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 424000, "to": 427000}, "text": " And I need a nuclear reaction tube to generate the 1.21 gigawatts of electricity."}, {"offsets": {"from": 427000, "to": 430000}, "text": " 1.21 gigawatts!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 431000, "to": 434000}, "text": " 1.21 gigawatts!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 435000, "to": 437000}, "text": " Thanks, God!"}, {"offsets": {"from": 439000, "to": 441000}, "text": " What the hell is a gigawatt?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 441000, "to": 444000}, "text": " So power, of course, equals voltage times current."}, {"offsets": {"from": 444000, "to": 449000}, "text": " So 1.21 gigawatts into the flux capacitor, divided by 500 kilovolts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 449000, "to": 452000}, "text": " We're talking 2420 amps."}, {"offsets": {"from": 452000, "to": 454000}, "text": " So I'm going to run with that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 454000, "to": 458000}, "text": " You know, that seems quite reasonable for a current flowing through one of these bad boys."}, {"offsets": {"from": 458000, "to": 461000}, "text": " So then we need to know what the resistance of the cable is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 461000, "to": 464000}, "text": " Well, I just chose a random online wire resistance calculator."}, {"offsets": {"from": 464000, "to": 467000}, "text": " I did double-check that this value with another calculator came out the same."}, {"offsets": {"from": 467000, "to": 472000}, "text": " So we're talking 3,200 kilometers here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 472000, "to": 474000}, "text": " Okay, 3,200 kilometers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 474000, "to": 478000}, "text": " So you've got to put, there it is, 3,200 meters times 1,000."}, {"offsets": {"from": 478000, "to": 483000}, "text": " And with our 1,300 square millimeter cross-sectional area,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 483000, "to": 485000}, "text": " which is a reasonable figure."}, {"offsets": {"from": 485000, "to": 487000}, "text": " It could be more, it could be less, but let's run with that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 487000, "to": 489000}, "text": " That gives us 42 ohms."}, {"offsets": {"from": 489000, "to": 490000}, "text": " Thank you very much."}, {"offsets": {"from": 490000, "to": 492000}, "text": " I'm 42,000 milliohms."}, {"offsets": {"from": 492000, "to": 496000}, "text": " A few milliohms fanboys have 42, good number, 42."}, {"offsets": {"from": 496000, "to": 497000}, "text": " So we'll run with that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 497000, "to": 503000}, "text": " So at 42 ohms and 3,200 kilometers, once again, multiply this for my 3,800 kilometer goof."}, {"offsets": {"from": 503000, "to": 505000}, "text": " P equals I squared R."}, {"offsets": {"from": 505000, "to": 507000}, "text": " These are your famous I squared R losses."}, {"offsets": {"from": 507000, "to": 509000}, "text": " Good terminology to use."}, {"offsets": {"from": 509000, "to": 511000}, "text": " Losses in the cable, I squared R losses."}, {"offsets": {"from": 511000, "to": 513000}, "text": " You know, that's just the lingo."}, {"offsets": {"from": 513000, "to": 517000}, "text": " 2420 amps squared times 42."}, {"offsets": {"from": 517000, "to": 521000}, "text": " If you put that into Confuse, you get 245 megawatt loss."}, {"offsets": {"from": 521000, "to": 522000}, "text": " That's actually huge."}, {"offsets": {"from": 522000, "to": 526000}, "text": " So if you divide that by your 1.21 gigawatts into your flux capacitor,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 526000, "to": 528000}, "text": " that's 20% cable loss."}, {"offsets": {"from": 528000, "to": 533000}, "text": " Now, look, they're not going to, no one's going to accept a 20% cable loss."}, {"offsets": {"from": 533000, "to": 538000}, "text": " So ways around that, of course, are to use thicker cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 538000, "to": 539000}, "text": " Use a higher voltage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 539000, "to": 544000}, "text": " And of course, when you start talking square factors, that can reduce it a lot."}, {"offsets": {"from": 544000, "to": 548000}, "text": " So if you just simply run two of these identical cables side by side,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 548000, "to": 551000}, "text": " yeah, you double your cost, because copper's expensive."}, {"offsets": {"from": 551000, "to": 554000}, "text": " And, you know, cost for laying it out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 554000, "to": 558000}, "text": " And it's probably a cost between, difference between laying one or two cables at the same time."}, {"offsets": {"from": 558000, "to": 560000}, "text": " Doesn't really matter, because you've got to have the ship,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 560000, "to": 562000}, "text": " and you've got to lay the damn thing,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 562000, "to": 565000}, "text": " and, like, dig the trenches or whatever, and then build the facilities,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 565000, "to": 567000}, "text": " and, oh, everything else, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 567000, "to": 568000}, "text": " It's probably not."}, {"offsets": {"from": 568000, "to": 570000}, "text": " You're just paying for the extra copper, really."}, {"offsets": {"from": 570000, "to": 574000}, "text": " So that would be a 61, that would be 61 megawatts,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 574000, "to": 577000}, "text": " so a quarter, because you've halved the current."}, {"offsets": {"from": 577000, "to": 580000}, "text": " It'd be 1210 amps now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 580000, "to": 584000}, "text": " So it, because that's a squared factor, I squared R,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 584000, "to": 590000}, "text": " if you halve the current, then the power goes down by a factor of 4."}, {"offsets": {"from": 590000, "to": 595000}, "text": " But, so that's only 61 megawatts, as opposed to 245 megawatts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 595000, "to": 598000}, "text": " So that's around about a 5% loss,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 598000, "to": 600000}, "text": " because a quarter of the loss."}, {"offsets": {"from": 600000, "to": 602000}, "text": " 20% before, 5% now."}, {"offsets": {"from": 602000, "to": 606000}, "text": " But because you've got two cables, 61 megawatts loss in each,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 606000, "to": 609000}, "text": " now it's a total system loss of 10%."}, {"offsets": {"from": 609000, "to": 612000}, "text": " And, you know, these are reasonable ballpark figures,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 612000, "to": 617000}, "text": " and do they actually match what's, you know, typical figures out there?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 617000, "to": 620000}, "text": " Well, after I did this, I could have skipped all this"}, {"offsets": {"from": 620000, "to": 623000}, "text": " and just read this document here, which I'll link in."}, {"offsets": {"from": 623000, "to": 625000}, "text": " It's, where is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 625000, "to": 628000}, "text": " And we're page 11 of 79, so what is it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 628000, "to": 630000}, "text": " JRC Technical Report, European Commission,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 630000, "to": 632000}, "text": " high-voltage DC submarine power cables in the world,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 632000, "to": 636000}, "text": " state-of-the-art knowledge, 2015, you know, it's not that old."}, {"offsets": {"from": 636000, "to": 641000}, "text": " So if we go down to here, yeah, they just give us typical figures."}, {"offsets": {"from": 641000, "to": 644000}, "text": " Here it is, DC and AC flow in a conductor."}, {"offsets": {"from": 644000, "to": 647000}, "text": " The skin effect, we're of course high-voltage DC systems,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 647000, "to": 649000}, "text": " so none of that skin effect rubbish."}, {"offsets": {"from": 649000, "to": 653000}, "text": " And look, they give you, look, 1,000 or 2,000 kilometers,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 653000, "to": 659000}, "text": " like 6.4, 64, 6.4 gigawatts, okay?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 659000, "to": 662000}, "text": " So this is a much bigger system."}, {"offsets": {"from": 662000, "to": 666000}, "text": " So look, it looks like, you know, bigger systems exist than this one."}, {"offsets": {"from": 666000, "to": 668000}, "text": " So I thought, oh jeez, this is huge."}, {"offsets": {"from": 668000, "to": 671000}, "text": " I mean, apparently for these high-voltage DC systems,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 671000, "to": 674000}, "text": " you know, it's a bit on the runty side, actually."}, {"offsets": {"from": 674000, "to": 676000}, "text": " And they're saying 800 kilovolts here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 676000, "to": 678000}, "text": " so that might be more of a standard."}, {"offsets": {"from": 678000, "to": 681000}, "text": " If I saw this, you know, you could run the numbers again, maybe."}, {"offsets": {"from": 681000, "to": 685000}, "text": " But anyway, they have estimated losses 3.5% to 5%."}, {"offsets": {"from": 685000, "to": 688000}, "text": " So yeah, that's pretty similar to where we were at."}, {"offsets": {"from": 688000, "to": 690000}, "text": " So there you go, if we did our calculations"}, {"offsets": {"from": 690000, "to": 693000}, "text": " and, you know, upped the voltage a bit and stuff like that,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 693000, "to": 697000}, "text": " like, our losses were, you know, fairly on par there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 697000, "to": 701000}, "text": " Using, of course, a thicker cable, higher voltage, less losses."}, {"offsets": {"from": 701000, "to": 705000}, "text": " Yeah, you can easily see where you get around 3.5% to 5%."}, {"offsets": {"from": 705000, "to": 708000}, "text": " You know, like, I'm sure this report would have,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 708000, "to": 711000}, "text": " is it, this is two examples of losses."}, {"offsets": {"from": 711000, "to": 712000}, "text": " So these are examples."}, {"offsets": {"from": 712000, "to": 716000}, "text": " And these are just the loss in the power transmission cables, I assume."}, {"offsets": {"from": 716000, "to": 722000}, "text": " So not a loss in the actual, then the power converters on each side of that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 722000, "to": 723000}, "text": " And they've got some examples here."}, {"offsets": {"from": 723000, "to": 729000}, "text": " The Xianghai line is the world's first ultra-high-voltage DC connection."}, {"offsets": {"from": 729000, "to": 732000}, "text": " Operates at, oh, plus, right, 800 kilovolts is ultra-high."}, {"offsets": {"from": 732000, "to": 735000}, "text": " So we're kind of on the mark there with the 500 kilowatts."}, {"offsets": {"from": 735000, "to": 740000}, "text": " Transfers 7.2 gigawatts from the hydropower in southeast China,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 740000, "to": 742000}, "text": " which is 2,000 kilometers away."}, {"offsets": {"from": 742000, "to": 744000}, "text": " Wow, it's a single overhead line."}, {"offsets": {"from": 744000, "to": 746000}, "text": " That's not an underwater transmission line."}, {"offsets": {"from": 746000, "to": 750000}, "text": " Not sure if you get the 800 kilovolts on undersea ones."}, {"offsets": {"from": 750000, "to": 753000}, "text": " I don't know. If anyone knows, leave it in the comments down below."}, {"offsets": {"from": 753000, "to": 756000}, "text": " But anyway, yeah, it seems like this, you know, these sort of, you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 756000, "to": 760000}, "text": " 3.5, 5%, if you could get better than that, I guess they'd tell you."}, {"offsets": {"from": 760000, "to": 762000}, "text": " Of course, you'd try and achieve."}, {"offsets": {"from": 762000, "to": 765000}, "text": " But once you're down, you know, 3% or 5% loss seems acceptable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 765000, "to": 767000}, "text": " 10% or 20% you start to go,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 767000, "to": 769000}, "text": " oh, that's a bit sucky, isn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 769000, "to": 771000}, "text": " What are we doing this for?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 771000, "to": 774000}, "text": " So because somebody's got to pay for that, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 774000, "to": 776000}, "text": " They're going to be charging."}, {"offsets": {"from": 776000, "to": 783000}, "text": " I wonder, would Australia charge Singapore for the power transmitted"}, {"offsets": {"from": 783000, "to": 785000}, "text": " rather than the power delivered?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 785000, "to": 787000}, "text": " I guess we would."}, {"offsets": {"from": 787000, "to": 789000}, "text": " Why not?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 789000, "to": 790000}, "text": " We have to generate it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 790000, "to": 793000}, "text": " So yeah, I reckon the customer would probably bear the loss"}, {"offsets": {"from": 793000, "to": 795000}, "text": " of the transmission ones."}, {"offsets": {"from": 795000, "to": 797000}, "text": " I don't know. Does anyone know?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 797000, "to": 799000}, "text": " Anyone seen these sorts of contracts?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 799000, "to": 800000}, "text": " Let us know."}, {"offsets": {"from": 800000, "to": 802000}, "text": " But yeah, these things are possible."}, {"offsets": {"from": 802000, "to": 804000}, "text": " So, you know, 3% or 5%."}, {"offsets": {"from": 804000, "to": 805000}, "text": " Interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 805000, "to": 806000}, "text": " Monopolar interconnectors."}, {"offsets": {"from": 806000, "to": 808000}, "text": " Now we get into the monopolar configuration"}, {"offsets": {"from": 808000, "to": 810000}, "text": " with earth return and..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 810000, "to": 812000}, "text": " So there it is. Seems easy, doesn't it?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 812000, "to": 814000}, "text": " Just a transformer, just a rectifier,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 814000, "to": 816000}, "text": " just a DC resistance line."}, {"offsets": {"from": 816000, "to": 818000}, "text": " Well, that's true. It's just a DC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 818000, "to": 820000}, "text": " It's just a cable, just a copper cable."}, {"offsets": {"from": 820000, "to": 821000}, "text": " Don't do anything fancy."}, {"offsets": {"from": 821000, "to": 823000}, "text": " They don't have to make them aluminium."}, {"offsets": {"from": 823000, "to": 825000}, "text": " None of that aluminium rubbish."}, {"offsets": {"from": 825000, "to": 827000}, "text": " Aluminium because..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 827000, "to": 830000}, "text": " Like they do for some of the overhead lines"}, {"offsets": {"from": 830000, "to": 831000}, "text": " because of the weight."}, {"offsets": {"from": 831000, "to": 834000}, "text": " Copper, aluminium's lighter than copper."}, {"offsets": {"from": 834000, "to": 836000}, "text": " So the big overhead cables,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 836000, "to": 838000}, "text": " they want to get the weight down"}, {"offsets": {"from": 838000, "to": 839000}, "text": " because, you know, they sag."}, {"offsets": {"from": 839000, "to": 841000}, "text": " It's a real big problem."}, {"offsets": {"from": 841000, "to": 843000}, "text": " So anyway, and then an inverter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 843000, "to": 844000}, "text": " No worries."}, {"offsets": {"from": 844000, "to": 845000}, "text": " And a filter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 845000, "to": 846000}, "text": " No worries."}, {"offsets": {"from": 846000, "to": 849000}, "text": " Sounds easy, right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 849000, "to": 852000}, "text": " Sounds like these are tiny little buildings."}, {"offsets": {"from": 852000, "to": 854000}, "text": " But let's actually have a look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 854000, "to": 855000}, "text": " Let's actually have a look."}, {"offsets": {"from": 855000, "to": 858000}, "text": " I googled high voltage DC power station"}, {"offsets": {"from": 858000, "to": 859000}, "text": " and stuff like this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 859000, "to": 860000}, "text": " I mean, check out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 860000, "to": 861000}, "text": " Check out this."}, {"offsets": {"from": 861000, "to": 862000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 862000, "to": 863000}, "text": " Right?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 863000, "to": 865000}, "text": " What the heck is that?"}, {"offsets": {"from": 865000, "to": 868000}, "text": " You probably aren't even allowed to stand under that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 868000, "to": 869000}, "text": " Check out."}, {"offsets": {"from": 869000, "to": 871000}, "text": " Like they've got like the metal wall seems"}, {"offsets": {"from": 871000, "to": 872000}, "text": " very close to that."}, {"offsets": {"from": 872000, "to": 873000}, "text": " Or is that..."}, {"offsets": {"from": 873000, "to": 874000}, "text": " Oh no, no."}, {"offsets": {"from": 874000, "to": 875000}, "text": " It's a whole thing away."}, {"offsets": {"from": 875000, "to": 876000}, "text": " Okay, I was going to say"}, {"offsets": {"from": 876000, "to": 878000}, "text": " if it's like close to that metal back wall"}, {"offsets": {"from": 878000, "to": 880000}, "text": " get fucking over it."}, {"offsets": {"from": 880000, "to": 881000}, "text": " I don't know what I'm looking at"}, {"offsets": {"from": 881000, "to": 883000}, "text": " but damn, it's impressive."}, {"offsets": {"from": 883000, "to": 885000}, "text": " And that's a power filter."}, {"offsets": {"from": 885000, "to": 886000}, "text": " Wow."}, {"offsets": {"from": 886000, "to": 888000}, "text": " This is great stuff."}, {"offsets": {"from": 888000, "to": 889000}, "text": " If anyone works inside"}, {"offsets": {"from": 889000, "to": 891000}, "text": " like one of these high voltage DC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 891000, "to": 892000}, "text": " converter plants,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 892000, "to": 893000}, "text": " please let us know"}, {"offsets": {"from": 893000, "to": 895000}, "text": " because it's just, yeah,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 895000, "to": 896000}, "text": " it's very impressive."}, {"offsets": {"from": 896000, "to": 897000}, "text": " And you might be interested"}, {"offsets": {"from": 897000, "to": 899000}, "text": " why high voltage DC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 899000, "to": 900000}, "text": " instead of like transmitting"}, {"offsets": {"from": 900000, "to": 902000}, "text": " normal like 50 Hz number,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 902000, "to": 904000}, "text": " 60 Hz rubbish AC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 904000, "to": 906000}, "text": " Well, transmission line losses."}, {"offsets": {"from": 906000, "to": 907000}, "text": " AC, of course,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 907000, "to": 909000}, "text": " you get the skin effect on the cables"}, {"offsets": {"from": 909000, "to": 911000}, "text": " and it reduces the efficiency"}, {"offsets": {"from": 911000, "to": 912000}, "text": " of the cables."}, {"offsets": {"from": 912000, "to": 913000}, "text": " So semiconductor thyristors"}, {"offsets": {"from": 913000, "to": 915000}, "text": " able to handle 4000 amps"}, {"offsets": {"from": 915000, "to": 916000}, "text": " and block high voltages"}, {"offsets": {"from": 916000, "to": 917000}, "text": " up to 10 kilovolts"}, {"offsets": {"from": 917000, "to": 919000}, "text": " are needed for the widespread adoption"}, {"offsets": {"from": 919000, "to": 920000}, "text": " but they got those."}, {"offsets": {"from": 920000, "to": 921000}, "text": " Newer semiconductors,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 921000, "to": 922000}, "text": " voltage source converters,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 922000, "to": 923000}, "text": " transistors that can rapidly switch"}, {"offsets": {"from": 923000, "to": 924000}, "text": " between two voltages"}, {"offsets": {"from": 924000, "to": 927000}, "text": " has allowed power DC converters."}, {"offsets": {"from": 927000, "to": 928000}, "text": " Increased benefits,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 928000, "to": 929000}, "text": " long distance transmission,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 929000, "to": 930000}, "text": " increased competition"}, {"offsets": {"from": 930000, "to": 932000}, "text": " because like you probably"}, {"offsets": {"from": 932000, "to": 933000}, "text": " couldn't do this"}, {"offsets": {"from": 933000, "to": 935000}, "text": " sort of in like 3800 km"}, {"offsets": {"from": 935000, "to": 937000}, "text": " at 50 Hz."}, {"offsets": {"from": 937000, "to": 938000}, "text": " You probably can't do it"}, {"offsets": {"from": 938000, "to": 939000}, "text": " whereas DC,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 939000, "to": 941000}, "text": " there's no skin effect."}, {"offsets": {"from": 941000, "to": 943000}, "text": " There's no AC resistance effect."}, {"offsets": {"from": 943000, "to": 944000}, "text": " There's nothing."}, {"offsets": {"from": 944000, "to": 945000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 945000, "to": 946000}, "text": " A DC line has lower construction costs"}, {"offsets": {"from": 946000, "to": 948000}, "text": " than an AC line."}, {"offsets": {"from": 948000, "to": 949000}, "text": " That's interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 949000, "to": 950000}, "text": " And there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 950000, "to": 951000}, "text": " There's a crossover point"}, {"offsets": {"from": 951000, "to": 953000}, "text": " for AC versus DC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 953000, "to": 954000}, "text": " It seems to be"}, {"offsets": {"from": 954000, "to": 956000}, "text": " like anything over 250 km"}, {"offsets": {"from": 956000, "to": 958000}, "text": " it starts to become"}, {"offsets": {"from": 958000, "to": 960000}, "text": " better to send it over"}, {"offsets": {"from": 960000, "to": 961000}, "text": " high voltage DC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 961000, "to": 963000}, "text": " at plus minus 400 kilovolts"}, {"offsets": {"from": 963000, "to": 964000}, "text": " as opposed to 400"}, {"offsets": {"from": 964000, "to": 965000}, "text": " like AC lines,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 965000, "to": 966000}, "text": " your typical towers"}, {"offsets": {"from": 966000, "to": 967000}, "text": " that you're used to."}, {"offsets": {"from": 967000, "to": 968000}, "text": " They use"}, {"offsets": {"from": 968000, "to": 970000}, "text": " 1200 square millimeter conductors,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 970000, "to": 972000}, "text": " 1600 square millimeters"}, {"offsets": {"from": 972000, "to": 974000}, "text": " over here for the high voltage DC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 974000, "to": 975000}, "text": " but yeah,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 975000, "to": 976000}, "text": " you can go"}, {"offsets": {"from": 976000, "to": 977000}, "text": " like thousands of kilometers"}, {"offsets": {"from": 977000, "to": 979000}, "text": " and losses in megawatts,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 979000, "to": 981000}, "text": " it seems to start to add up."}, {"offsets": {"from": 981000, "to": 982000}, "text": " So once you get like,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 982000, "to": 983000}, "text": " you know,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 983000, "to": 984000}, "text": " 1000 plus kilometers"}, {"offsets": {"from": 984000, "to": 985000}, "text": " that's a decent amount"}, {"offsets": {"from": 985000, "to": 986000}, "text": " of extra loss in there."}, {"offsets": {"from": 986000, "to": 987000}, "text": " And it looks like"}, {"offsets": {"from": 987000, "to": 988000}, "text": " you can get"}, {"offsets": {"from": 988000, "to": 990000}, "text": " smaller lines as well."}, {"offsets": {"from": 990000, "to": 992000}, "text": " Look, for a 2 gigawatt"}, {"offsets": {"from": 992000, "to": 994000}, "text": " capacity line"}, {"offsets": {"from": 994000, "to": 996000}, "text": " you need like much smaller towers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 996000, "to": 997000}, "text": " Look at this,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 997000, "to": 999000}, "text": " the 50 meters"}, {"offsets": {"from": 999000, "to": 1000000}, "text": " instead of 85 meters,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1000000, "to": 1002000}, "text": " 500 kilovolts DC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1002000, "to": 1004000}, "text": " instead of 800 kilovolts AC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1004000, "to": 1006000}, "text": " So yeah,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1006000, "to": 1008000}, "text": " like because over many kilometers"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1008000, "to": 1009000}, "text": " you need one of these"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1009000, "to": 1010000}, "text": " every couple hundred meters"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1010000, "to": 1011000}, "text": " or something."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1011000, "to": 1012000}, "text": " Your costs add up"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1012000, "to": 1013000}, "text": " when you've got to"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1013000, "to": 1015000}, "text": " physically construct"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1015000, "to": 1016000}, "text": " these towers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1016000, "to": 1017000}, "text": " Yeah, and then you've got"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1017000, "to": 1019000}, "text": " the right of way as well,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1019000, "to": 1021000}, "text": " which is basically the area"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1021000, "to": 1022000}, "text": " that they have to buy up"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1022000, "to": 1023000}, "text": " all the homes for"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1023000, "to": 1024000}, "text": " or can't allow to,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1024000, "to": 1025000}, "text": " not allowed to build"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1025000, "to": 1026000}, "text": " anything else."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1026000, "to": 1027000}, "text": " You've got to have a corridor"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1027000, "to": 1028000}, "text": " going through"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1028000, "to": 1029000}, "text": " where you can't basically"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1029000, "to": 1031000}, "text": " build anything under them."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1031000, "to": 1033000}, "text": " And designed to carry,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1033000, "to": 1035000}, "text": " is 70% wider"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1035000, "to": 1037000}, "text": " for a 2 gigawatt line"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1037000, "to": 1038000}, "text": " AC than it is for DC."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1038000, "to": 1039000}, "text": " So that's significant."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1039000, "to": 1040000}, "text": " You've got to potentially"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1040000, "to": 1042000}, "text": " buy up and waste"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1042000, "to": 1043000}, "text": " a lot more land"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1043000, "to": 1045000}, "text": " that you can't actually develop."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1045000, "to": 1046000}, "text": " Operation and maintenance"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1046000, "to": 1047000}, "text": " costs are lower"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1047000, "to": 1048000}, "text": " for an optimized"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1048000, "to": 1049000}, "text": " high voltage DC system."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1049000, "to": 1050000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1050000, "to": 1051000}, "text": " Than an AC system."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1051000, "to": 1052000}, "text": " That's interesting."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1052000, "to": 1053000}, "text": " Typical break-even distances"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1053000, "to": 1055000}, "text": " in terms of miles."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1055000, "to": 1056000}, "text": " And here it is."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1056000, "to": 1057000}, "text": " In this case,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1057000, "to": 1058000}, "text": " particularly suit,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1058000, "to": 1059000}, "text": " high voltage DC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1059000, "to": 1060000}, "text": " is particularly suited"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1060000, "to": 1061000}, "text": " to undersea transmission"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1061000, "to": 1062000}, "text": " where losses from AC"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1062000, "to": 1063000}, "text": " are large."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1063000, "to": 1064000}, "text": " There you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1064000, "to": 1065000}, "text": " The first one was in Sweden."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1065000, "to": 1066000}, "text": " I don't want my Swedish viewers."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1066000, "to": 1067000}, "text": " And if you're wondering"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1067000, "to": 1068000}, "text": " why can't we use"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1068000, "to": 1070000}, "text": " all of the 10 gigawatts here,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1070000, "to": 1072000}, "text": " because it only,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1072000, 