000}, "text": " Trade-off for cost maybe."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1100000, "to": 1101000}, "text": " So yes,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1101000, "to": 1102000}, "text": " obviously some of that"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1102000, "to": 1104000}, "text": " will go to Singapore"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1104000, "to": 1105000}, "text": " and some of that"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1105000, "to": 1106000}, "text": " will be used locally."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1106000, "to": 1107000}, "text": " And the other"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1107000, "to": 1108000}, "text": " will go into storage"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1108000, "to": 1109000}, "text": " so that during the night,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1109000, "to": 1110000}, "text": " it can,"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1110000, "to": 1111000}, "text": " it can then"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1111000, "to": 1112000}, "text": " continuously"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1112000, "to": 1113000}, "text": " send that out"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1113000, "to": 1114000}, "text": " from the storage bank"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1114000, "to": 1115000}, "text": " instead of"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1115000, "to": 1117000}, "text": " directly from the panels themselves."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1117000, "to": 1118000}, "text": " So there's no point"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1118000, "to": 1120000}, "text": " having any storage at all"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1120000, "to": 1121000}, "text": " if you're consuming"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1121000, "to": 1123000}, "text": " all of the 10 gigawatts"}, {"offsets": {"from": 1123000, "to": 1124000}, "text": " during the day."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1124000, "to": 1125000}, "text": " There's no point."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1125000, "to": 1126000}, "text": " None will go into storage."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1126000, "to": 1127000}, "text": " It'll all be just used."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1127000, "to": 1128000}, "text": " So there you go."}, {"offsets": {"from": 1128000, "to": 1129000}, "text": " That was interesting."